1
00:00:00,527 --> 00:00:02,897
(Raj:)...maybe there's still a future for us.

2
00:00:03,062 --> 00:00:06,262
(Raj:)The funny thing about life
is that sometimes something you think...

3
00:00:06,466 --> 00:00:08,396
(Amy:)Does he ever shut up?

4
00:00:08,568 --> 00:00:11,198
(Raj:)But then it turns good again
and that means it's better...

5
00:00:11,371 --> 00:00:13,241
...than if it had never been bad a while.

6
00:00:13,406 --> 00:00:17,006
And now things aren't good.
They are in fact...

7
00:00:17,677 --> 00:00:18,697
(Raj:)...very, very bad...

8
00:00:18,878 --> 00:00:23,368
(Raj:)...but at least my heart is starting to heal.
Slowly, but surely.

9
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:27,750
How I cried, it was like a little thunderstorm
on my face.

10
00:00:27,921 --> 00:00:30,751
(Raj:)But I'm a man, okay?
So I need to pull myself together...

11
00:00:30,924 --> 00:00:33,914
(Raj:)...pick up a pen and get it all out
in my journal. I mean...

12
00:00:34,093 --> 00:00:38,083
...it's not all bad. Having my heart broken
has allowed me to speak in front of you...

13
00:00:38,264 --> 00:00:40,094
...so, you know, the silver lining.

